0..73 Comment "// Where transport does not run. The machine lowers a transport, the HoTT"
74..152 Comment "// book\'s § 2.3 (`transport`), only where conversion computes it, and refuses"
153..229 Comment "// the rest by the family\'s head. Three refusals follow. At a family of path"
230..303 Comment "// types conversion computes transport along reflexivity, but the machine"
304..381 Comment "// lowers no such family. At a function family neither the normaliser nor the"
382..456 Comment "// kernel computes transport along `ua`. And `back(p)` has no image in the"
457..520 Comment "// machine as a transport\'s path. The rows these need are #706."
522..596 Comment "/// A reflexive transport at a path-type motive does not run: the family\'s"
597..628 Comment "/// head is a path type (#706)."
